#: mainwindow.cpp:249
msgid ""
"kbthandsfree needs support for SCO sockets in for voice transmission over "
"bluetooth. Unfortunately, SCO is broken in many kernel revisions. Please refer "
"to the online documentation of kdebluetooth for more information."
msgstr ""
"kbthandsfree necesita de soporte para sockets SCO para transmitir voz sobre "
"bluetooth. Por desgraza o soporte SCO non funciona en moitas versións do "
"kernel. Vexa a documentazón de kdebluetooth para mais informazón."

